                <p rendition="#flush">I. <hi rendition="#italic">Franco-Italian Frontier</hi></p>
                <p><hi rendition="#italic">Rectification No. 4, Tenda and Briga district</hi></p>
                <p>After an exchange of views the Council agreed to resume discussion of this
                    question at a later meeting.</p>
                <pb facs="0635" n="613" xml:id="pg613"/>
                <p rendition="#flush">II. <hi rendition="#italic">Limitations on the Italian
                        Navy</hi></p>
                <p>After a discussion of the Naval Experts’ Report (C.F.M.(46) 121)<anchor n="7"
                        xml:id="d199-f1"/> no agreement was arrived at.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">III. <hi rendition="#italic">Clauses Concerning the
                        Danube</hi></p>
                <p>The Soviet Delegation tabled a proposal on the Danube (C.F.M. (46) 135).<anchor
                        n="8" xml:id="d199-f2"/> It was agreed to resume discussion of this proposal
                    at the Council’s next meeting.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">IV. <hi rendition="#italic">Personal Injuries</hi></p>
                <p>(<hi rendition="#italic">Draft Peace Treaty with Roumania</hi> (C.F.M.(D) (46)
                    182. Art. 32)<anchor n="9" xml:id="d199-f3"/></p>
                <p>Art. 32 of the Draft Treaty with Roumania, dealing with personal injuries, was
                    deleted.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">V. <hi rendition="#italic">Mixed Arbitral Tribunals</hi></p>
                <p>(<hi rendition="#italic">Draft Peace Treaty with Roumania</hi> (C.F.M.(D) (46)
                    182. Annex VI)<anchor n="9" xml:id="d199-f4"/></p>
                <p>It was agreed that this question should be considered by the Deputies at their
                    next meeting.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">VI. <hi rendition="#italic">Next Meeting</hi></p>
                <p>Council of Foreign Ministers, Tuesday, 25th June, at 4 p.m.</p>
